I_INTERACTION:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|CHARACTER_RENDER:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|MONSTER_READABILITY:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|MOTION_TRANSITIONS:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE\ninspectionIndex=ACTION_IMPACT:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|CAMERA_COMPOSITION:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|WORLD_BACKGROUND:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|GRAPHICS_INTEGRITY:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|NAVIGATION_BLOCKERS:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE\ninspectionIndex=PROGRESSION_BLOCKERS:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|RECOVERY_SAVE:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|MULTIPLAYER_CONSISTENCY:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|MOBILE_PERFORMANCE:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|LOBBY_SPACES:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE\ninspectionEvidence=EXACT_GAME_SOURCE_ARTIFACT_VERSION_SCENE_VIEWPORT_INPUT_STATE_CAPTURE_SHA256_FINDING_OWNER_RETEST; compare same scene before/after; motion needs timed frames. Thumbnail/transport/static QA/counts never prove visual quality.\ninspectionRule=Use centrally allowed observation only. Missing exact render stays UNVERIFIED, not an invented defect/PASS. Reproduce real failure, repair existing owner, run impact QA, rebuild/replay same scene; preserve save/balance/server authority.\ninspectionScene=ACTION_IMPACT:기존 주 행동의 준비→실행→판정→회복, 빗나감·피격·취소·연속 입력\ninspectionFailure=ACTION_IMPACT:판정보다 먼저 데미지 표현·허공 타격 피드백·VFX/음향 지연·쿨다운 표시 불일치·연속 입력 고착\ninspectionOwner=ACTION_IMPACT:기존 서버 판정과 클라이언트 모션/VFX/음향 사건 연결\ninspectionRetest=ACTION_IMPACT:authoritative impact 시점과 시각/음향 타임라인 비교; 데미지·쿨다운·히트 의미 보존\ninspectionScene=PROGRESSION_BLOCKERS:첫 세션 핵심 루프와 기존 중후반 해금·퀘스트·보상·다음 지역 연결\ninspectionFailure=PROGRESSION_BLOCKERS:다음 행동 없음·퀘스트 완료 불가·보상 중복/누락·상태 불일치·다음 지역으로 진행 불가\ninspectionOwner=PROGRESSION_BLOCKERS:기존 목표·퀘스트·보상·진행 상태 책임 시스템\ninspectionRetest=PROGRESSION_BLOCKERS:성공/실패/재시도 분기의 상태 전후 및 다음 행동 연결; 승인 없는 경제/밸런스 변경 금지\nEXPERIENCE_BUILD_UP: {\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ACTIVE_EXECUTABLE_BUILD